Inspired by a True Friendship.

2
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:24,260
Green Book is a drama, comedy, history film directed by Peter Farrelly.

3
00:16:57,391 --> 00:17:03,391
Tony Lip, a bouncer in 1962, is hired to drive pianist Don Shirley on a tour through the Deep South in the days when African Americans, forced to find
alternate accommodations and services due to segregation laws below the Mason-Dixon Line, relied on a guide called The Negro Motorist Green Book.

4
